IQ Boost is a game with tricky puzzles, tasks and logic tests. 
All the tasks are original and funny! We said ‘NO’ to boring brain training.
Free IQ Boost game features only the best tasks, brainteasers and exercises to train your memory, attention, logic and mindset. 

Only 10% of all the people have an IQ higher than 120. Are you among them? Play IQ Boost - challenge your brain.

Try yourself in solving nontrivial tasks. You will train logical and abstract thinking by solving puzzles and logic tasks. Сoncentration and memory will be better too. 
Have a good time while training your brain. 

Find out your IQ level. Lower than you thought? Play IQ Boost and you’ll see your IQ is growing. 

Game features:
• Easy to play;
• Nonstandard colourful gameplay;
• Funny answers and solutions;
• Nontrivial challenges for any age;
• Lots of levels;
• Intellectual brain-teaser game.

Remember: obvious solutions might not be not always right...think out of the box and train your brain! Play and prove you are the cleverest!

Do you want to experience something different from the usual football games you play? Football Rivals is just for you.

This is a multiplayer football game that brings football fans together. Team up with your friends and lead your team to success! 

Start your football career
Millions of players from all over the globe are waiting for you in this soccer game, where you can meet new friends and join a supportive community. Here, teamwork makes the difference!

Deal football cards to attack your rivals and make history with your friends help!! Participate in exciting matches where you will have to prove your team spirit and tactical skills. A football game you shouldn't miss out on!

Join your local football community
Find and team up with people from your country to support your national soccer team!  Lots of friends that love soccer games just like you do are waiting for you. Who knows, maybe those friendships that you will start in Football Rivals can transform into real ones, and you will have new mates to go to real soccer games with! 

Main Features
• Join a Team: collaborate, make strategies and play matches with other real people;
• Finish the Academies to gain skills;
• Team customization - logo, avatars, description, statuses;
• Team Chat: where you can talk to your teammates and prepare the strategies for the upcoming competitions;
• Matches - participate with your team in simplified football matches against other teams;
• Use emojis to communicate your thoughts to your opponents;
• Energy to play a slot machine - attack opponents in a penalty shootout mini-game, help your teammates & friends with gifts, level up and become the hero of your team
• Football game competitions - participate in competitions like: Champions Cup, Continental Cup, National Cup, Super Cup, World Nations Cup;
• In World Nations Cup, your team can take over different National Teams and bring them to glory in the qualifying, groups and knockout stages;
• Training Sessions: a 50 players competition where the biggest goal is to increase your level faster; 
• Thematic Golden Ball Competitions - with the possibility of unlocking unique items that will help you on each match.

Deal football cards, play matches, win and become a champion.
In this Mehrspieler football game, players from all over the world can connect, build friendships, create the best teams and fight together for the same goals. Football Rivals is your daily escape from real life where you can be part of your dream football team.

Multiplayer football game you have to try out!
Your goal is to win trophies and fight for a better place in the National and World Rankings. The adrenaline increases during the LIVE matches played against other Real Players, this is why being ACTIVE, especially during the live match, is an essential part. To win, besides Energy, you’ll also need your teammates. You need to be there for them, no matter what! To draw the winning football cards and become champions together. One thing is for sure - Teamwork helps you SCORE in Football Rivals!

An online football world in your hands!
You can connect your social media account to find your friends easily and make new ones! Join the Football Rivals online soccer community on Facebook and Instagram, and stay updated with contests, new features, releases, and news!

Football Rivals is free to play, but some items can be purchased for real money.
A network connection is required to play!

For any issues or suggestions regarding the game, contact us at: support.footballrivals@greenhorsegames.com

Play in "Cash Masters" game and choose whom you want to become! Philanthropist or playboy? Millionaire or Billionaire?

You can try to grow up the career ladder from rags and poverty to a top specialist or even a head of a company! Become an entrepreneur and open one or more businesses in a row. Invest wisely and make influential acquaintances with the cream of society.

Anyone can become rich and conquer the world! Prove to everyone that there is no one better and richer than you in the whole universe. Spend money as you like and enjoy life.

Develop personal relationships with beautiful women. Choose the best and make her a marriage proposal. Build a family, raise children, and then grandchildren. Feel family happiness!

Accumulate millions in your account, buy businesses, enjoy the decisions you make. And if something goes wrong at a certain moment, then use the time machine, go back in time and start all over again!

Features of "Cash Masters" game:
- Easy path to riches;
- Tons of earning options;
- A lot of luxury items;
- Many ways for development;
- Different ways to earn money;
- Colorful graphics and heroes;
- Fun and addictive gameplay;
- Amazing choices and plot;
- Billions of money in our game!

When all money in the world become yours, you will have to select between planet safe and your own pleasure...

If you decide to save the planet, you can build a spaceship and colonize a new planet! Build a reliable and technologically advanced ship, prepare the essentials for colonization, and set off on a space journey!

And if you choose entertainment, well—your decision. Let every million spent be a joy to you. Collect cars, meet the hottest girls and dive into the most pleasant moments of life with billions in your account. Forget about traffic jams with your personal yacht and business jet. Live in a luxurious mansion outside the city, in a villa on a private island, or in the most luxurious apartment in the center of the metropolis.

Everyone can become a rich person, you just have to want it. When you earned all money in the world, you can choose: spend it all on yourself or save the planet and all living beings? The choice is yours! Play in the game, earn all money in the world and become the best!
